 "provenance": "Bavaria 2 (w1 l1) normal exit, control-only on the exact S700 core. Start: lives 12 (campaign-style value used by earlier routes), weaponTier 1 (Bavaria seal grants the hammer), maxHealth 4. First 422 ticks re-play the intent of the old port attempt bavaria-02-two-crushers (entrance boulder, bricks, rollers destroy crusher 22, checkpoints 1-2, pocket at 30,9). Then: brick 29,8 hammered so stones 29,6-7 drop and roller 28,6 destroys crusher 31,5-6; brick 31,9 and diamond column 32 to checkpoint 32,14; tick-timed pass under three spikes to checkpoint 18,17; bricks 16-17,15-16 hammered so roller 17,15 destroys crusher 13; grass cuts drop stones on crushers 10 and 8; health chest 5,18; checkpoint 7,14; crawler loop timed to checkpoint 10,11; grass 13,11 hammered so roller 14,11 drops to 11,13; stone 25,10 pushed into pit 26,13; column 26 to the exit 34,6. Diamond lock tile (33,6) is cleared at load in this S700 build, so the 35-diamond count is not needed.",
